  data: {
    LLM: "Card Counting: Since you know every card your opponent has, the game becomes a puzzle. Identify which suits you dominate and lead them early to draw out trumps.\n\nTrump Management: If you have the higher trumps, use them to kill your opponent's Aces in their long suits.\n\nEndplay positioning: Force your opponent into a 'Throw-in' where they must lead into your winning cards in the final few tricks.",
